<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD FOOD · GOOD DAYS</view><view class="row between"><view class="pill">{{space}}</view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">处理中…</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="title">一起，好好吃饭</view><view class="subtitle">一个人收藏，一家人一起做。</view><view wx:if="{{isShared}}" class="hero"><view class="heading">{{space}}</view><view class="note">当前角色：{{role}}。共享修改需联网；冲突时先刷新，再重新应用修改。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="refreshCloud">刷新共享数据</button><button bindtap="personal">回到个人空间</button><button bindtap="invite">生成编辑成员邀请</button><button wx:if="{{role==='owner'}}" bindtap="revokeInvitations">撤销旧邀请</button><button class="danger" bindtap="leave">退出厨房</button></view><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="uid" class="row between field"><text>{{item.label}} · {{item.role}}</text><button wx:if="{{role==='owner'}}" bindtap="manageMember" data-uid="{{item.uid}}">管理</button></view><button wx:if="{{inviteToken}}" open-type="share" class="primary">分享厨房邀请</button><view wx:if="{{inviteToken}}" class="note">邀请已复制，24 小时有效，最多使用 10 次。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">连接我的云开发</view><view class="note">本地模式无需配置。联网需真实云环境、kitchen 云函数及已设置权限的集合；此处只填写环境 ID。</view><input placeholder="云环境 ID（不是 AppID）" value="{{env}}" data-field="env" bindinput="field"/><view class="actions"><button bindtap="saveEnv">保存并检查连接</button><button bindtap="listKitchens">查看我的厨房</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">建立共享厨房</view><input value="{{kitchenName}}" data-field="kitchenName" bindinput="field"/><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="createKitchen">创建厨房</button></view><view class="label">接受邀请</view><input placeholder="粘贴邀请口令" value="{{joinToken}}" data-field="joinToken" bindinput="field"/><button bindtap="join">确认加入</button></view><view wx:for="{{kitchens}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="enterKitchen" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="heading">{{item.name}} ›</view></view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="backup">个人备份与回收站</button></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">我的 AI 服务</view><view class="note">{{aiLabel}}</view><button id="ai-settings-entry" bindtap="aiSettings">设置服务、模型与 API Key</button></view></view>